OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud remains in the north but
OL,6,Flifts and breaks through the day.
OL,7,FBrighter in the south with more sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Another warm with temperatures
OL,9,Fabove average.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry this evening and
OL,12,Fovernight with variable amounts of
OL,13,Fcloud with some clear spells. Thicker
OL,14,Fcloud arrives across the north of the
OL,15,Fregion towards dawn with outbreaks of
OL,16,Flight rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
