OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FOvercast with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, this locally heavy and
OL,7,Fpersistent across the hills and
OL,8,Fmountains of north Wales. Becoming
OL,9,Fdrier and brighter from the west
OL,10,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FLargely settled through Thursday and
OL,14,FFriday, with chilly nights and bright,
OL,15,Fsunny days. Temperatures will feel
OL,16,Fwarm in the sunshine. Increasing
OL,17,Fcloudy from Saturday, bringing the
OL,18,Frisk of some rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
